<p>As long as you have at least a stack of Sadist whenever you take damage you use <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">21, 17, 15, 14, 13</acronym> psi to harness your stacks of Sadist to divide the damage by your stacks + 1.</p><p>Each time this happens a random foe in sight with 80% or less life left will take a backlash of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">33%, 51%, 62%, 69%, 74%</acronym> of the absorbed damage as mind damage.</p><p>This effect can only happen once per turn and only triggers for hits over 10% of your max life.</p>